# 26. AUTOMATIC ALERT ENGINE

Develop a centralized and reliable alert engine.

It must evaluate:

1. Subject marks below 60%.
2. Two or more consecutive unexplained absences.
3. Three or more missing notebooks in one subject per school week.
4. Three or more missing textbooks in one subject per school week.
5. Three or more complaints in the same category.
